    "sampleSentences": [
      {
        "id": "sen_g5a_0787",
        "english": "The Spring Festival is an important festival in China. People go home to join their families.",
        "chinese": "春节在中国是一个重要的节日。人们回家与家人团聚。"
      },
      {
        "id": "sen_g5a_0788",
        "english": "Mrs Zhang is very busy. She's cooking for her family and relatives. All of her relatives meet at her house for dinner on the eve of the Spring Festival.",
        "chinese": "张太太很忙。她正在为她的家人和亲戚做饭。除夕夜，她所有的亲戚都在她家聚餐。"
      },
      {
        "id": "sen_g5a_0789",
        "english": "They have a big and delicious meal together. This is the reunion dinner.",
        "chinese": "他们一起吃一顿丰盛美味的饭。这就是团圆饭。"
      },
      {
        "id": "sen_g5a_0790",
        "english": "Children enjoy the Spring Festival most. They wear new clothes. They get red packets from their parents and relatives.",
        "chinese": "孩子们最喜欢春节。他们穿新衣服。他们从父母和亲戚那里得到红包。"
      },
      {
        "id": "sen_g5a_0791",
        "english": "In the evening, they light firecrackers. During the day, they watch lion dances. They have great fun.",
        "chinese": "晚上，他们放鞭炮。白天，他们看舞狮。他们玩得非常开心。"
      }
    ],
    "parentOutcome": "孩子完成后，应能在准备春节团圆集市的情境中识别并使用春节活动相关表达。",
