      {
        "id": "sen_g6a_1159",
        "english": "Her family often has breakfast at 6:45 a.m.",
        "chinese": "她的家人经常在早上6:45吃早饭。"
      },
      {
        "id": "sen_g6a_1160",
        "english": "After breakfast, she waves goodbye to her mother and goes to school.",
        "chinese": "早饭后，她向妈妈挥手道别去上学。"
      },
      {
        "id": "sen_g6a_1161",
        "english": "Katie returns home at 5:00 p.m. She often does her homework before dinner. She plays chess with her father after dinner.",
        "chinese": "凯蒂下午5:00回家。她经常在晚饭前做作业。晚饭后她和爸爸下国际象棋。"
      },
      {
        "id": "sen_g6a_1162",
        "english": "John is an old scientist. He studies birds. He always gets up very early.",
        "chinese": "约翰是一位老科学家。他研究鸟类。他总是起得很早。"
      }
